# Character policy for the repository. Every grant below is intentional: the
# comment records why a file type needs more than the ASCII floor.
* ascii

*.c ascii+legal
*.exempt ascii+caveman
*.md ascii+caveman
*.txt ascii+legal+caveman
*.pkl ascii+box+caveman
*.bats ascii+caveman
*.nix ascii+caveman
*.plist ascii+caveman
*.sh ascii+caveman
*.toml ascii+caveman
.context-limits ascii+caveman
SPEC.md ascii+caveman+math+spec-logic
tests.rs ascii+caveman+marks+pl+en-aux
**/tests/*.rs ascii+caveman+marks+pl+en-aux
docs/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md ascii+caveman+legal
